  "final_answer": "**Yes—one component-issue event for manufacturing order `MO-25-09-1070` was created 75 minutes after September entered Pending Close. Its recorded `POSTED` status is inconsistent with Oracle’s documented treatment for this type of newly created transaction.**\n\n### Event identified\n\n| Item | Finding |\n|---|---|\n| Work order | `WO-2025-09-004` / `MO-25-09-1070` |\n| Operation / product | Modine Racine–Dekoven / Cooler Plate Pack |\n| Cost period | `Sep-25` (`PER-COST-2025-09`) |\n| Cost event | `CE-250904-0004` — `INPUT` / component issue |\n| Source transaction | `TXN-ISSUE-250930-1070` |\n| Event amount | **USD $284,763.42** — 28,476,342 cents |\n| Event-created time | **`2025-09-30T19:15:00`** |\n| Pending Close time | **`2025-09-30T18:00:00`** |\n| Time after Pending Close | **75 minutes** — 1 hour 15 minutes |\n| Recorded accounting status | **`POSTED`** |\n\nThe calculation is `19:15:00 − 18:00:00 = 4,500 seconds ÷ 60 = 75 minutes`. Both timestamps are reproduced exactly as recorded; the source supplies no time-zone offset.\n\n### Oracle policy assessment\n\nOracle’s *Cost Accounting Period Statuses and Transaction Accounting* documentation states that new transactions falling in or before a Pending Close period are not staged or processed until the period is closed or reopened. It specifically says transactions created after the pending-close date will not be processed, while revenue lines, COGS recognition, and manual cost adjustments remain exceptions.\n\nThis event is a newly created **component issue**, dated September 30—not one of those exceptions. Therefore, its **`POSTED` status is inconsistent with the supplied policy**.\n\n**Sources:** work-order and cost-period records from `system/oracle_scm_cost_management/state.db`; event details from the cached supporting-record package; Oracle SCM Cost Management 26B documentation, PDF page 233 / printed page 225.\n\nNo database records were changed. The audit result and provenance were saved to `/cache/work/worker_65f014a597ee/audit-report.json`. The structured report was submitted, but automated validation remains marked `needs_evidence`.",
